      en: ["The park was designated a UNESCO Biosphere Reserve in 1979", "Mount San Valentín is the highest peak in Patagonia at 4,058 meters", "The San Rafael Glacier has a front width of approximately 2 kilometers", "The national park covers an area of about 1,742,000 hectares", "The lagoon was discovered in 1766 by the explorer Juan García Tao", "The San Rafael Glacier is the closest tidewater glacier to the equator"],
